overview.description:
The Cloud Bureau is a boutique consulting shop focused on the Salesforce platform and its adjacencies. We deliver big-firm expertise, sophistication, and value at accessible, straightforward rates. We specialize in core platform functionality, Sales and Service Clouds, and nonprofit solutions (Nonprofit Success Pack, Nonprofit Cloud, and Education Cloud), and our industry expertise includes nonprofit administration, commercial real estate and financial services, and higher education.

Our services include:
- Project-based development (e.g., integrations, custom user interface development with Lightning Web Components, code refactoring or removal, business process design and implementation);
- Fractional administration (retained or on-demand);
- Org assessment and road-mapping; and 
- Embedded co-implementation, wherein we partner with your in-house resources to implement a Salesforce solution.
